pg3DQ&oe=6B045B5B"}, "display_name": "The Golden Thread", "keywords": ["Meditation", "Spiritual", "Mindfulness", "Musical"], "long_description": "The Golden Thread is an immersive VR musical experience that invites participants on a poetic and contemplative journey of self-discovery, inner alignment, and cosmic connection. Set to the high-frequency harmonies of Beautiful Chorus, the experience unfolds across ethereal landscapes \u2013 gardens, starscapes, and celestial cloud realms \u2013 each reflecting a different stage of transformation and awareness.\n\nGuided by luminous beings of light and elemental energy, participants follow a metaphysical golden thread \u2013 a symbol of intuition and inner guidance \u2013 through three phases: connection to nature, expansion into limitless potential, and arrival into a space of safety, love, and belonging. Each movement is inspired by a song and theme: Dear Moon (energy), Star (possibility), and Goodnight Moonchild (protection).\n\nDesigned as a meditative and emotional journey rather than a traditional narrative, It offers a soulful portal for viewers to reconnect with their essence and feel held within the greater fabric of existence.\n", "short_description": "An immersive VR musical journey with Beautiful Chorus. Travel through realms of light, nature, and cosmos to awaken presence, intuition, and belonging."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://iwanttoexperience.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://iwanttoexperience.com/terms", "publisher_name": "https://iwanttoexperience.com/", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.beautifulchorus.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "in